# Dependencies and build artifacts (regenerated inside the image)
**/vendor
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.angular

# Editor and VCS metadata
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*

# Secrets and local configuration
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Compose and tooling files (not used at build time)
docker-compose*.yaml
compose*.yaml
Makefile
**/*.md
